      "rev_n_1_d4552d_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_d4552d_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_d4552d",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous reasoning was that it didn't account for the case where a snake could potentially visit multiple rooms before returning to its starting point. This approach missed some returnable rooms. Let's improve the reasoning by considering the entire path a snake might take before potentially returning to a room.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_d4552d_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_2e10ec0de5",
        "created_at": 1794536102.838575
      },
      "rev_n_2_e9ac2b_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_e9ac2b_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_e9ac2b",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The current approach of checking reachability from each room individually can lead to incorrect results, especially for cases where multiple snakes can form a single cycle. A more robust approach would be to consider the overall structure of the conveyor belts and identify all cycles in the system. This would allow us to determine which rooms are part of any cycle and mark them as returnable.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_e9ac2b_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_bc42d43d90",
        "created_at": 1794536219.832949
      },
      "rev_n_3_0ce33b_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_0ce33b_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_0ce33b",
        "thought_text": "I need to refine the reasoning to avoid the observed error. The current approach of checking reachability from each room individually can miss cycles that involve multiple rooms. Instead, we should consider the overall structure of the conveyor belts and their interactions. The key insight is that a room is returnable if and only if it's part of a strongly connected component (SCC) in the graph formed by the conveyor belts, where each SCC represents a cycle or a set of rooms that can reach each other.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_0ce33b_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_ed6e6f0f57",
        "created_at": 1794536284.2540698
